      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10706897::web::029::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding WC particles to an HEA matrix reduces wear relative to the unreinforced HEA.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10706897::web::029::4_conclusions",
        "PMC8949536::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The untreated starting HEA has a homogeneous, unreinforced microstructure.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The untreated starting HEA is self-lubricating.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "WC-reinforced HEA can be produced by laser cladding.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8949536::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "WC particles can be incorporated into an HEA by powder metallurgy.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The friction and wear benefits of WC reinforcement persist from room temperature to approximately 800 °C.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention produces uniformly dispersed WC particles in the HEA matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dispersed WC particles refine the HEA microstructure.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "WC particles promote formation of a protective, self-lubricating tribolayer during sliding.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increasing WC content increases the hardness of the HEA-based cladding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8949536::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "WC facilitates formation of a lubricious tribofilm.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed lubricious tribofilm minimizes direct metal-to-metal contact.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The combination of increased hardness and reduced metal-to-metal contact lowers both friction and wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10706897::web::029::4_conclusions",
        "PMC8949536::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "There is an appropriate or optimal WC content for obtaining the friction benefit.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10706897::web::029::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Insufficient WC can cause inadequate lubrication and diminish tribological performance.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Excessive WC can increase brittleness and diminish tribological performance.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The magnitude of friction and wear reduction may vary with processing parameters and operating conditions.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
